  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the above diagram, the equations are,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OA</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>OC</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;angle with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p>"
